{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"535aefdd-4850-4845-8677-21ab3e1f1e8f","ts":"2026-07-26T12:50:08.881-05:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"294","nodeName":"DeepSeek Chat Model","workflowName":"My workflow","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatDeepSeek","workflowId":"IqhxSGlB1Zsi0TSG","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: Eres un asistente que extrae información estructurada de currículums (CVs).\\n\\nAnaliza el siguiente texto extraído de un PDF y determina:\\n1. Si el documento es realmente un CV/currículum de una persona (no un documento de otro tipo, como un manual, curso, o factura)\\n2. Si es un CV, extrae la información solicitada\\n\\nSi no se menciona directamente el total de años de experiencia, calcúlalo sumando la duración de cada experiencia laboral listada (convierte meses y semanas a fracciones de año, ej. 1 mes = 0.08, 2 semanas = 0.04). Nunca dejes years_experience como null si hay al menos una experiencia laboral listada.\\n\\nResponde ÚNICAMENTE con un JSON válido, sin texto adicional, sin markdown, con esta estructura exacta:\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"es_cv\\\": true o false,\\n  \\\"full_name\\\": \\\"nombre completo o null si no aplica\\\",\\n  \\\"email\\\": \\\"correo del candidato o null\\\",\\n  \\\"phone\\\": \\\"teléfono o null\\\",\\n  \\\"years_experience\\\": número decimal o null,\\n  \\\"skills\\\": [\\\"array\\\", \\\"de\\\", \\\"habilidades\\\", \\\"técnicas\\\"],\\n  \\\"education\\\": [{\\\"degree\\\": \\\"título\\\", \\\"institution\\\": \\\"institución\\\", \\\"year\\\": \\\"año\\\"}],\\n  \\\"experience\\\": [{\\\"company\\\": \\\"empresa\\\", \\\"role\\\": \\\"cargo\\\", \\\"duration\\\": \\\"duración\\\"}]\\n}\\n\\nSi el documento NO es un CV, responde solo:\\n{\\\"es_cv\\\": false}\\nHuman: G´enesis Kerly Pozo Tomal´a\\nResidence/domicile: Ecuador, Provincia Santa Elena, Parroquia Colonche, comuna loma alta\\nE-mail: pozogenesis1@gmail.com ✼ Cell phone number: +593 986 783 438\\nId: 0922803333 ✼ Date of birth: 30-10-1999\\nEducation\\nBachelor’s Degree in Chemistry Yachay Tech University\\nBachelor’s Degree Program September 2018 – May 2025\\nHigh School Diploma in Sciences (International Baccalaureate) Unidad Educativa Anc´on\\nHigh School Program May 2012 – March 2018\\nThesis Topic\\nSynthesis and Characterization of Cerium Oxide Nanoparticles Supported on Nano-Clays for their\\nPotential Catalytic Application. The study involved the chemical functionalization of clays via co-\\nprecipitation, purification of clay-based materials, and the use of a static Parr HPS 4790 series reactor\\nfor controlled material synthesis.\\nProfessional Experience & Extracurricular Activities\\nChemistry club instructor: Community-service pre-professional practicum April-June 2023\\nProject explanation: Unidad Educativa Fiscomisional Salesiana S´anchez y Cifuentes\\nDevelopment, guidance, advising, and training on the use of laboratory materials and chemical reagents\\nthrough the design and execution of demonstrative experiments for Second Baccalaureate students.\\nDuration 102 hours.\\nResearch assistant: Separation, purification and characterization of Ecuadorian clays as\\nprecursors of nanoclays for CO\\n2 \\ncapture and conversion July-September 2022\\nProject explanation: Urcuqu´ı, Imbabura\\nResearch assistant associated with the project “Use of Ecuadorian clays for CO\\n2 \\ncapture and conver-\\nsion,” focused on ferruginous clays for acid gas capture. Responsibilities included sample preparation,\\nchemical analysis, and physicochemical characterization of materials using FT-IR, XRD and TGA. Also\\nassisted the professor in practical teaching sessions, supporting students in the handling of characteri-\\nzation equipment (UV-Vis, FT-IR, XRD, chromatography). Duration 240 hours.\\nUndergraduate researcher: Synthesis and characterization of cerium oxide nanoparticles\\nsupported on nano-clays 2024-2025\\nProject explanation: Urcuqu´ı, Imbabura\\nSynthesis of clay-supported metal oxide nanoparticles via co-precipitation for potential catalytic appli-\\ncations, including purification of clay-based materials and use of a static Parr HPS 4790 series reactor\\nfor controlled synthesis.\\nAssociate researcher: HAWSEN March 2021 – March 2022\\nProject explanation: Quito, Ecuador\\nAssociate researcher in the analysis of seismic-resistant and bio-friendly concretes applied to 3D-printing\\nconstruction, as part of the HAWSEN 3D-printing construction project.\\nCourse: Industrial processes course May-September 2022\\nCourse Description: Ibarra, Imbabura\\nThis course incorporates technical and engineering elements to analyze and understand the transfor-\\nmation of raw materials into finished products, where the fundamentals of Chemical Engineering are\\napplied. Duration 96 hours.\\nTraining: Basic Risk Prevention Course February 2023\\nTraining Description: Urcuqu´ı, Imbabura\\n\\nBasic training on occupational risk prevention principles applicable to laboratory and industrial work\\nenvironments. Duration 2 hours.\\nProcess Supervisor: Shrimp Packing Plant (LangosMar) June 2026\\nProject explanation: Pascuales, Guayaquil\\nSupervised loaders and stevedores in the shipping and cold storage areas, and oversaw and reconciled\\nthe deheading, machine freezing, and tunnel freezing processes. Managed inventory of masterized\\nproducts, bin traceability, and pallet traceability, using pivot tables for stowage planning and label\\ninventory control. Responsible for product intake, handling of Gigasoft software, and use of the Santa\\nPriscila Salem system for master label generation. Applied Santa Priscila IT tools for master liquidation\\nin shipments and performed weight-tail liquidation for product grading and classification.\\nAdditional Trainings & Conferences\\nFeb 2023 Series of Conferences GIAMP and CATS – Attendee. Yachay Tech University\\nJul 2023 Expert Conference: Cosmetic Chemistry. Yachay Tech University\\nOct 2023 XXX Congreso Peruano de Qu´ımica – XXX Congreso Italo-Latinoamericano de\\nEtnomedicina “Olga Lock de Ugaz”. Sociedad Qu´ımica del Per´u, Lima, Per´u\\n(40 h)\\nApr-Jun 2025 Rural Youth Entrepreneurship School: Agriculture of the Future, Adapting to\\nNew Challenges. Ministerio de Agricultura y Ganader´ıa, Ecuador (70 h)\\nAug 2025 ISO 9001 Standards Course. Ministerio del Trabajo, Ecuador (3 h)\\nTechnical skills\\nProgramming & Data Analysis Python (Intermediate), R (Intermediate), MATLAB (Ad-\\nvanced), L\\nA\\nTEX; analysis of experimental data\\nScientific Software OriginLab (Advanced), QualX (Advanced), SmartLab Studio\\nII, TGA55, Spect (Advanced)\\nMolecular Modeling & Simula-\\ntion\\nChemDraw, Avogadro (Intermediate), Orca, Gaussian (Inter-\\nmediate)\\nOffice & Documentation Microsoft Excel, Word, PowerPoint (intermediate)\\nPorous Materials Porous adsorbent materials for CO\\n2 \\ncapture (metal oxides sup-\\nported on nanoclays)\\nMaterials Synthesis Synthesis Methods by Coprecipitation and Purification by Dif-\\nferential Sedimentation (Advanced); general chemical synthesis\\nand compound purification\\nSample Handling Sample preparation, purification, and functionalization; prepa-\\nration and standardization of solutions (Advanced); labora-\\ntory equipment handling (Advanced); chemical waste manage-\\nment (Advanced); development and optimization of experimen-\\ntal protocols\\nPhysicochemical Characteriza-\\ntion\\nTextural and structural characterization; UV-Vis, IR, NMR,\\nAAS spectroscopy (Intermediate); X-ray diffraction (Ad-\\nvanced); chromatography, GC, HPLC (Intermediate)\\nAnalytical Quality Validation of analytical methods (Intermediate); physicochem-\\nical analysis of water and soil (Intermediate)\\nChemistry Domains Organic and inorganic chemistry (Intermediate); materials\\nchemistry (Advanced); biochemistry (Intermediate); pharma-\\nceutical chemistry (Basic)\\nRegulatory & Documentation ISO 9001 standards (Intermediate); technical report writing\\nand safety data sheets, MSDS (Advanced)\\n\\nScientific Writing Drafting of scientific articles and technical reports; data docu-\\nmentation and record-keeping\\nCommunication Oral and written presentation on the progress of the research\\nSoft Skills Teamwork, performance under pressure, assertive communi-\\ncation, adaptability, quick learning and teaching ability, time\\nmanagement, multidisciplinary learning\\nLanguage proficiencies\\nSpanish C2 mother tongue\\nEnglish B2 (88/120), certified by Yachay Tech Language Center\\nPersonal references\\nErnesto Bastardo Gonzales PhD in Chemical Sciences – 0968098163\\nEdward Ebner ´Avila Sosa PhD in Materials Science – 0999731954\\nJulio Alejandro Quillupangui Cadena Nanotechnology Engineer – 0984923208\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://api.deepseek.com\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"es_cv\\\": true,\\n  \\\"full_name\\\": \\\"Génesis Kerly Pozo Tomalá\\\",\\n  \\\"email\\\": \\\"pozogenesis1@gmail.com\\\",\\n  \\\"phone\\\": \\\"+593 986 783 438\\\",\\n  \\\"years_experience\\\": 2.5,\\n  \\\"skills\\\": [\\n    \\\"Python\\\",\\n    \\\"R\\\",\\n    \\\"MATLAB\\\",\\n    \\\"LaTeX\\\",\\n    \\\"OriginLab\\\",\\n    \\\"QualX\\\",\\n    \\\"SmartLab Studio II\\\",\\n    \\\"TGA55\\\",\\n    \\\"Spect\\\",\\n    \\\"ChemDraw\\\",\\n    \\\"Avogadro\\\",\\n    \\\"Orca\\\",\\n    \\\"Gaussian\\\",\\n    \\\"Microsoft Excel\\\",\\n    \\\"Microsoft Word\\\",\\n    \\\"PowerPoint\\\",\\n    \\\"Porous adsorbent materials for CO2 capture\\\",\\n    \\\"Synthesis by Coprecipitation\\\",\\n    \\\"Purification by Differential Sedimentation\\\",\\n    \\\"General chemical synthesis and compound purification\\\",\